021)\n\nThe game has only picked up the pace. remaining a meta-juxtaposed masterpiece. A game Rife with corporate greed, but, refreshingly in none of the places you'd expect these days. it's beautifully interwoven into the great satire this game brings to the table, on top of being a solid team based action shooter. I winced a little when i heard of seasonal content, but again, I was amazed to see that it stands as a great example to others what seasonal content should look like.\n\nIn closing I would just like to say on a personal note. This is one of the few games i feel no guilt in purchasing supporter packs and DLC related stuff, because this teams earns in in spades for what they do give us freely. Keep up the great work!", "timestamp_created": 1543615427, "timestamp_updated": 1636171903, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47216220", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983013787", "personaname": "Druidlogic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/druidlogic/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 35387, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1593, "last_played": 1753933985, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the better co-op experiences on Steam. Support this great game. Rock and Stone brothers.", "timestamp_created": 1543606993, "timestamp_updated": 1543606993, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": 